name bfh-ci
category Package
revision 62951
shortdesc Corporate Design for Bern University of Applied Sciences
longdesc This bundle provides possibilities to use the Corporate Design
longdesc of Bern University of Applied Sciences (BFH) with LaTeX. To
longdesc this end it contains classes as well as some helper packages
longdesc and config files together with some demo files.
